Investigate particle transport at increasing depth (@cm-transport-studies: 0, is #chapter, #part-of @clean-manufacturing, #source "../sources/Single-Particle-Transport-Kulkarni-Baron-Willeke.lingua#r_34AB62TA1PZDEMM8QQZ0W3A06B", #clean-manufacturing "Reconstruct-a-mobility-and-slip-inference.lingua#r_0PD86GWHJ9NJ5TS6MZCM3SHM00", #clean-manufacturing "Defend-a-collector-and-surface-deposition-model.lingua#r_7PS657D6554B04ANX10S7AGG4W", #clean-manufacturing "Defend-a-number-and-material-population-balance.lingua#r_4TB8G06YD28ET8585ANAECEPBY") { r_4R2YMXXJEVP9YHX5D7BKVXNXRT
**Read:** Complete the available Ahmadi aerosol notes, Mei's derivation and the NIST slip paper; use [Fundamentals of single-particle transport — Kulkarni, Baron and Willeke](../sources/Single-Particle-Transport-Kulkarni-Baron-Willeke.lingua#r_34AB62TA1PZDEMM8QQZ0W3A06B) for the broader force and measurement connections.

The next three investigations examine particle mobility, collecting surfaces and evolving populations. Carry a consistent definition of size, number, material mass and uncertainty through all three. Use actual source equations and data where supplied, and identify unavailable evidence rather than inventing it.

**Work:** Complete each investigation with an original derivation, an independently checked calculation and criticism of the underlying assumptions. At least one should compare a prediction with published observations, including the limitations of data extraction and source access. The column program can support a bounded subproblem; it does not replace the full investigation.

**Return:** [Clean manufacturing and contamination control — from familiar objects to controlled processes](../Clean-manufacturing-and-contamination-control.lingua#r_7D8SQ8BVQDZQBDBGC6DP0JAMZN).
**Continue in clean manufacturing:** [Reconstruct a mobility and slip inference](Reconstruct-a-mobility-and-slip-inference.lingua#r_0PD86GWHJ9NJ5TS6MZCM3SHM00), [Defend a collector and surface-deposition model](Defend-a-collector-and-surface-deposition-model.lingua#r_7PS657D6554B04ANX10S7AGG4W), [Defend a number and material population balance](Defend-a-number-and-material-population-balance.lingua#r_4TB8G06YD28ET8585ANAECEPBY).

